# M13: Insert > Date and Insert > Time in the header, then print the page as text. The header view shows the fields by name; the printed
# page has the clock's date and time (the host's run has no clock, so only the DOS run checks the text, in dos/tools/e2e.sh).
o n e space
f10 right right right right right right enter         # Document > Header
f10 right right down down down enter                  # Insert > Date
space a t space
f10 right right down down down down down enter        # Insert > Time
f10 right right right right right right down down down down down enter   # Document > Return to Document
f10 down down down down enter          # File > Print...
o u t period p r n enter
f10 end enter     # File > Exit
n
